nly if that card covers this car, and you tick that you will pay with it. Otherwise, OPCF 27: tick that you will upload your policy (the pink slip and the endorsement page). Otherwise, the Protection Plan.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">The Protection Plan applies at once: pay the difference with <b class="gd-ui">Pay</b> on your booking. Moving off the Protection Plan needs your proof (a photo or PDF); our team checks it and the change applies once approved. You can withdraw the request while it waits.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">During your trip you can add the Protection Plan; your own insurance or card coverage is set before pickup. After damage is reported, the protection stays as it was.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="before-pickup-sharing-your-location-at-pickup-and-return" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sharing your location at pickup and return</h2><p class="gd-p">With your permission, the CarmaCars app or the website shares where you are with our team only two hours either side of your pickup and your return, so we can meet you. At any other time nothing is taken. Turn it off any time in <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Location on the live map</b>.</p></section>');
