## Your location on a job

Accept the electronic monitoring policy once (you get a copy by email). While you are on shift or on a job, the CarmaCars app shares where you are so Fleet can dispatch and you can prove a pickup or return. During an active job it stays on; off duty nothing is taken. Turn it off between jobs in **Profile** > **Location on the live map**.',
